# ClickUp 3.0 Strict Design Contract

When refactoring or creating UI components, strictly replicate ClickUp's signature high-density, flat, utility-first SaaS interface. Never use generic large cards, floating rounded widgets, or heavy shadows.

**Accent precedence:** On surfaces following this contract, use ClickUp brand purple `#7B68EE` (not Wildberries `--accent` / `#cb11ab`). See exception in `brand-accent.mdc`.

**When to apply**
- New UI features and screens: implement to this contract by default.
- Existing UI not yet migrated: when a functional task touches that surface (or is a natural fit), **propose a redesign** to this contract before or alongside the feature work; wait for user approval before redesigning.

---

## 1. Design Tokens & Palette (Tailwind CSS)

### Backgrounds & Surfaces
- App Background (Canvas): `bg-[#F7F8FA]` (light) / `bg-[#18191B]` (dark)
- Primary Surface (Tables, Panels, Modals): `bg-[#FFFFFF]` / `bg-[#242528]`
- Secondary Surface (Sidebar, Filter bars): `bg-[#F9FAFB]` / `bg-[#1F2023]`
- Row / Item Hover: `hover:bg-[#F0F1F3]` / `dark:hover:bg-[#2D2E32]`
- Active / Selected Item: `bg-[#EBECEF]` / `dark:bg-[#34363A]`

### Borders & Dividers
- Base Border: `border border-[#E5E7EB]` / `dark:border-[#2F3136]`
- Subtle Separator (Rows, Inset Lines): `border-[#F1F2F4]` / `dark:border-[#282A2D]`
- Focus Outline: `outline-2 outline-[#7B68EE] outline-offset-1`

### Accent Colors (ClickUp Brand)
- Brand Purple: `#7B68EE` (`bg-[#7B68EE]` / `text-[#7B68EE]`)
- Brand Purple Hover: `#6952EB`
- Brand Magenta (Gradient/Pro badge): `#DA22FF`

### Statuses & Priority Badges
- Urgent (Red): `bg-[#FEE2E2] text-[#DC2626] border-[#FECACA]` / dark: `bg-[#451A1A] text-[#F87171] border-[#7F1D1D]`
- High (Yellow): `bg-[#FEF3C7] text-[#D97706] border-[#FDE68A]` / dark: `bg-[#45361A] text-[#FBBF24] border-[#785412]`
- Normal (Blue): `bg-[#E0F2FE] text-[#0284C7] border-[#BAE6FD]` / dark: `bg-[#16364D] text-[#38BDF8] border-[#075985]`
- Low (Gray): `bg-[#F3F4F6] text-[#6B7280] border-[#E5E7EB]` / dark: `bg-[#2B2D31] text-[#9CA3AF] border-[#3F4248]`
- Complete / Done (Green): `bg-[#DCFCE7] text-[#16A34A] border-[#BBF7D0]` / dark: `bg-[#143D23] text-[#4ADE80] border-[#166534]`

