## 2. Typography & Density Hierarchy
- Font Family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif.
- Headings: Compact, semi-bold (`text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight`).
- Body / Table Cell: `text-[13px] leading-tight font-normal text-[#292D34] dark:text-[#E2E4E9]`.
- Secondary / Meta / Timestamps: `text-[11px] font-medium text-[#7C828D] dark:text-[#9A9FA8]`.
- Section Headers / Column Labels: `text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-[#8C939F]`.

---

## 3. Geometry, Spacing & Sizing Rules
- Base Radius:
  - Pills / Status Badges: `rounded-[4px]`
  - Inputs / Buttons: `rounded-[6px]`
  - Modals / Popovers: `rounded-[8px]`
  - No large rounded corners (`rounded-xl` and `rounded-2xl` are strictly forbidden).
- Heights & Padding:
  - Table Row Height: Exactly `32px` (dense) to `36px` (normal). Never exceed `40px`.
  - Sidebar Item Height: `30px` with `px-2 py-1`.
  - Icon Buttons (actions): `w-6 h-6` or `w-7 h-7` with centered `14px`–`16px` SVG icons.
  - Cell horizontal padding: `px-2.5`.

---

## 4. Specific Component Anatomy & Interactions

### Data Rows (List & Table Views)
- Rows must span full width with a 1px border-bottom (`border-b border-[#F1F2F4] dark:border-[#282A2D]`).
- Row Selection: Checkbox on the left is hidden by default and becomes visible on row hover or when checked:
  - Container class pattern: `group relative flex items-center`.
  - Checkbox class pattern: `opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity`.
- Action Buttons (Rename, Delete, Copy link, More '...'):
  - Always right-aligned.
  - Hidden by default (`opacity-0`), visible on row hover (`group-hover:opacity-100`).
- Left Border Color Cue: Task group or status group must feature a `3px` solid colored vertical line on the far-left edge corresponding to the group's status.

### Chevrons & Collapsible Trees
- Chevron Icon: 12x12px or 14x14px (`stroke-[2]`, `text-[#8C939F]`).
- Chevron Placement: Directly before the group/task name with `mr-1.5`.
- Chevron Interaction: Smooth 90-degree transition when expanded:
  `transition-transform duration-150 ease-out transform group-data-[state=open]:rotate-90`.
- Hover behavior: Hovering over the chevron highlights only the chevron wrapper (`hover:bg-[#E4E6EA] rounded-[3px] p-0.5`).

### Status Dropdown Pill
- Layout: Inline-flex items-center gap-1.5, `h-[22px] px-2 text-[11px] font-medium rounded-[4px] cursor-pointer`.
- Circle Indicator (Optional classic ClickUp style): 6px solid dot on the left of status text.
- Dropdown Menu: Popover shadow `shadow-[0_4px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)]`, `p-1 border border-[#E5E7EB] rounded-[6px] bg-white`.

### Group Headers (Status/Category bar)
- Header row height: `28px`.
- Layout: Sticky top, flex items-center, background transparent or subtle surface.
- Left side: Chevron + Colored Badge with task count:
  - Badge: `text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px]`.
- Right side: Quick "Add Task" button (`+` icon button `opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100`).

---

## 5. Rules for Refactoring Code
1. Replace all bulky cards with border-delimited flat rows and columns.
2. Remove any shadows exceeding `shadow-sm` on standard content surfaces. Shadows belong strictly to floating dropdowns and modals.
3. Keep controls (assignee avatar, date picker, priority flag) inline-editable inside the table cells.
4. Use SVG icons with standard `14px` or `16px` sizes and `stroke-width="1.5"` or `"2"`.
